: "Visiting the Pyramids"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 11}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le11ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Make and Respond to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you make and respond to requests, remember to be polite."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the requests and responses below."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Making a Request </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Responding to a Request </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you mind \u2026<br /> Would you tell me ...<br /> Could you tell me ... <br /> I'd like to get ... <br /> Is there any chance you could \u2026\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure.<br />  No problem.<br /> Certainly.<br />  I'd be glad to help  .<br />  I'll see what I can do.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Anne</span>:Would you mind pointing out where Giza is?<br />  <span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: I'd be glad to help."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Anne</span>: Could you tell me how much a taxi costs? <br /><span class =\"strong\"> Concierge</span>: No problem."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Using the Infinitive of Purpose"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the<span class=\"italic\"> to</span> + verb (the infinitive)  to express purpose. This answers the question \"Why ... ?\u201d"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Action</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Purpose </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I go to the gym<br /> He locked the door\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to exercise.<br /> to keep everyone out.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Anne</span>: I want to get a taxi to go to the museum.<br /> <span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: You should bargain to get a good price."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Giza"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the third largest city in Egypt"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to visit the Pyramids in Giza."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about Egypt."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "downtown"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the central part of a city"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I went shopping downtown."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fare"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to pay money to travel on a bus, cab or other vehicle"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I gave the bus driver my fare to get on the bus."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Egyptian pounds"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " the official currency of Egypt"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I exchanged some money for Egyptian pounds."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I'd be glad to"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I would be pleased and happy to do something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'll be glad to travel to Egypt this summer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Write a short dialogue between you and a tourist."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell them where they can get a taxi. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain how to get a taxi driver's attention."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell them what the fares are like."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your dialogue with a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue with me and a tourist."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain about taxis and fares."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read me dialogue aloud with a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}